Z||000000||sqoach||04-27-2001||10:30 PM||||Everything seems to be pissing me off. I can't even get into the stupid chat! When I try to go to a room, it says I've been "opped"<BR>What the hell is that!?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>I'm about to go outta my mind! The love (questioning if I still love my car) of Fieros is killing me!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach2.JPG">   <BR>84 SE (project car?)<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)<BR>86 SC (daily driver)||||reg||8
